commit fdbedaf063e789d6befc36a91399bf52998f6ed0
Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 16:57:44 2026 +0330

    fix(qa4-t4-2): quick-add clears input immediately and locks it during the check
    
    Client test-4 bug 2: pressing Enter twice quickly merged two services
    into one label ('AC CleaningHandyman Services') because the input was
    only cleared AFTER the async relatedness check and had no re-entry
    guard. Now: addService clears the input at submit time and ignores
    re-entry while checkPending; the input is disabled during the check;
    the force-add flow is preserved (on an unrelated verdict the typed name
    is restored and the warning survives it — the watcher no longer clears
    a warning whose pending name is still in the input).
    ServiceSelector.test.ts: +3 QA4 tests (14 total, all green).

